    subtitle: Welcome back. Choose a mode and a posture, then start the scenario.
  - id: 601
    category: 4
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: be8a0b9f8ec33514c8caa8b5271db4dc, type: 3}
    volume: 1
